| 4,000 | 1 / 1 | 1 / 1 | 0 / 0 |
| 5,000 | 0 / 0 | 0 / 1 | 0 / 0 |
| 6,000 | 1 / 2 | 2 / 7 | 0 / 0 |
| 7,000 | 0 / 0 | 0 / 0 | 1 / 2 |
| 8,000 (requirement) | 0 / 1 | 2 / 3 | 10 / 11 |
| 9,000 | 0 / 1 | 0 / 0 | 1 / 1 |
| 10,000 | 0 / 0 | 0 / 0 | 0 / 0 |
| 12,000 | 0 / 0 | 1 / 1 | 0 / 0 |

